refore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(-3,-9),$  $(1,3)$, and $(3,9).$ \n\nSo, the correct answer is \" I only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186284173 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7d1252e9-f2ac-5adf-9cf5-ef48e35fb747" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Image of an Object Formed by a Singular Transformation"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f32b939-f8d4-5937-9f93-32dcb773d7f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/4d496eb67359340836a9d0dbce2a23bbcf3e01ac0f8c161aa3ff232b837a6326.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284175} {:answer/id #uuid "0a76143f-0c8c-5249-b635-c90a0d991c18" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/a209f0e3b428ba48d6cc2d21c50706820ff4524c13c8b012aea4d5d2dc4e60b1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284176} {:answer/id #uuid "fa308967-16da-5c48-862f-b9d70613ab74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/673749f65df3c2ab974e624dd93e11a1b924abd10b6c9bfbe6eb3f6f5b83436b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284177} {:answer/id #uuid "7e398868-37f6-5e72-83cb-82ca13b79d37" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/5c757942052cecc11d501cc636c72213250450240004c99ce6696cecd490f35e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284178} {:answer/id #uuid "13f14818-ccc2-5587-974c-0c96e771eb07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/1677b5d54b4776da993e508d77164fd9979011441b0c52cea169cead79900f48.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284179}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/